idasen-companion (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship a self-contained RPM that carries its own Python and Qt and installs
    on any RPM-based distribution rather than a single Fedora release.
  * Follow the desktop's theme more closely throughout the window, including
    a switch between light and dark while the app is open.
  * Group the activity log's entries under dated separators, and redraw the
    log in one pass instead of row by row.

